=== mutable struct{ } syntax ===
Stack: [ point{ x: 1 y: 2 } point{ x: 10 y: 20 } ]
Stack: [ point{ x: 1 y: 2 } point{ x: 10 y: 20 } ]
PASS: make-mpoint creates mpoint instance
Stack: [ point{ x: 1 y: 2 } point{ x: 10 y: 20 } mpoint{ mx: 10 my: 20 } ]
PASS: mutable mx>> gets mx field
Stack: [ point{ x: 1 y: 2 } point{ x: 10 y: 20 } mpoint{ mx: 10 my: 20 } ]
PASS: mutable my>> gets my field
Stack: [ point{ x: 1 y: 2 } point{ x: 10 y: 20 } mpoint{ mx: 10 my: 20 } ]
PASS: >>mx sets mx field
Stack: [ point{ x: 1 y: 2 } point{ x: 10 y: 20 } mpoint{ mx: 10 my: 20 } ]
PASS: >>my sets my field
Stack: [ point{ x: 1 y: 2 } point{ x: 10 y: 20 } mpoint{ mx: 10 my: 20 } ]
PASS: >>mx returns instance
Stack: [ point{ x: 1 y: 2 } point{ x: 10 y: 20 } mpoint{ mx: 10 my: 20 } ]
PASS: chained >>mx
Stack: [ point{ x: 1 y: 2 } point{ x: 10 y: 20 } mpoint{ mx: 10 my: 20 } mpoint{ mx: 1 my: 2 } ]
PASS: chained >>my
